    dct:description "Implements the Brillouin k = pi linear stability & sFlt1 decoy verifier (`verify_brillouin_instability_and_flt1_rescue`, L136-181), coupled M = 16 multicellular VEGFR2-Dll4-Notch1 + 2D filopodial sprout outgrowth solver (`simulate_vessel_notch_sprouting`, L202-395), 5-regime + sFlt1 rescue evaluator (`evaluate_angiogenic_regimes`, L398-429), and 8-point Notch trans-gain sweep (`evaluate_notch_gain_sweep`, L436-499), backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_060_vascular_angiogenesis_notch.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
