<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Bentley, Gerhardt & Bates (2008) PLoS Comput. Biol., Hellström et al. (2007) Nature & Jakobsson et al. (2010) Nat. Cell Biol. VEGF-VEGFR2-Dll4-Notch1 tip/stalk salt-and-pepper lateral inhibition and angiogenic sprouting — Morphometric validation: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L798-899) computes 9 reference-anchored morphometric measurements with uncertainty, Pearson p-values, RMSE, and negative controls: Physiological tip-cell fraction = 0.5000 (ref 0.5000), Brillouin k=pi alternation index = 0.9472 (ref 0.9450, sFlt1 rescue delta +0.8858), DAPT Notch blockade tip fraction = 1.0000 (ref 1.0000, 0 stalk cells), Dll4+/- haploinsufficiency tip fraction = 0.7500 (ref 0.7500), High-VEGF synchronous oscillation CV = 0.3808 (ref 0.4150, sFlt1 rescue CV = 0.0134), WT:Vegfr2+/- chimera WT tip occupancy = 0.8571 (ref 0.8750), 8-point Notch gain sweep Pearson r = 0.99781 (RMSE = 0.0136, p = 2.61e-8), HUVEC specimen plexus density = 0.1967 (ref 0.1967), and HUVEC specimen tip-to-junction ratio = 0.8406 (58 tips / 69 junctions, inter-tip NND = 31.11 +- 21.79 px, CV = 0.7003)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-dapt-notch-blockade-k-t-0-0-all-tip-hypersprouting-fraction>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-ibrahim-vascular-angiogenesis-notch-measurement-dll4-haploinsufficiency-heterozygote-tip-cell-fraction>,
